      "description": "Recessed pill well; the pressed segment rises as a white pill.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-seg\"><button aria-pressed=\"true\">Told the policy</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\">Unaided</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\">Told the Act</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-seg{display:inline-flex;border-radius:999px;background:var(--card-2,#f0f2f5);padding:3px;gap:2px}.ds-seg button{font:600 .86rem \"Segoe UI Variable Text\",system-ui,sans-serif;border:none;background:none;padding:5px 12px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink-2,#4d5560);border-radius:999px;transition:background .15s,color .15s}.ds-seg button:hover{color:var(--ink,#121417)}.ds-seg button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ours,#266ec4);outline-offset:2px}.ds-seg button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--card,#fff);color:var(--ink,#121417);box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(16,20,26,.05),0 6px 20px -8px rgba(16,20,26,.12)}"
    },
    {
