      "description": "Label with identity dot, a pill track whose fill grows in, and a mono value.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-bar\"><span><span class=\"ds-bdot\"></span>ours</span><div class=\"ds-track\"><i></i></div><b>32</b></div>",
      "css": ".ds-bar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:120px 1fr 48px;gap:10px;align-items:center;font:.88rem \"Segoe UI Variable Text\",system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#121417);width:420px}.ds-bdot{display:inline-block;width:.62em;height:.62em;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ours,#266ec4);margin-right:.45em}.ds-track{height:14px;background:var(--card-2,#f0f2f5);border-radius:999px;overflow:hidden}.ds-track i{display:block;height:100%;width:22%;border-radius:999px;background:var(--ours,#266ec4);transform-origin:left center;animation:ds-grow .9s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both}.ds-bar b{font-family:ui-monospace,\"Cascadia Mono\",Consolas,monospace;text-align:right;font-weight:400}@keyframes ds-grow{from{transform:scaleX(0)}to{transform:scaleX(1)}}@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-track i{animation:none}}"
    },
